<title>NETHERLANDS: AOT PROVISIONAL 1996 NET ALMOST DOUBLES.</title>
<headline>AOT PROVISIONAL 1996 NET ALMOST DOUBLES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full-year 1996 net</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	    4.69  vs   2.79</p>
<p>    Net profit			    19.7  vs  10.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  1.75 vs   1.25</p>
<p>    Gross trading result		48.4  vs   24.7</p>
<p>Note - Amsterdam Options Traders AOT said a high level of</p>
<p>activity on financial markets had boosted its provisional net</p>
<p>profit. It said the takeover of Borghols &amp; Ijdema, effective</p>
<p>January 1, 1997,would enable it to further expand its bond</p>
<p>trading activities.</p>
</text>
